# The whole check, at the moment the work leaves this machine.
#
# Under twenty seconds, of which the typecheck is ten and cannot be narrowed —
# TypeScript needs the whole project, so there is nothing to stage-scope here.
#
# CI remains the authority. This hook exists only for whoever ran `npm install`,
# and `git push --no-verify` skips it, so it is a convenience and never a gate.
npm run check
